[{"answer":"Good morning everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/1.mp3"},{"answer":"So today we're going to look at an important creative activity","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's hand knitting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ancient knitted garments have been found in many different countries,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/4.mp3"},{"answer":"showing that knitting is a global activity with a long history.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/5.mp3"},{"answer":"When someone says the word 'knitting'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/6.mp3"},{"answer":"we might well picture an elderly person -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/7.mp3"},{"answer":"a grandmother perhaps -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/8.mp3"},{"answer":"sitting by the fire knitting garments for themselves or other members of the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a homely image,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/10.mp3"},{"answer":"but one that may lead you to feel that knitting is an activity of the past -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and, indeed, during the previous decade,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/12.mp3"},{"answer":"it was one of the skills that was predicted to vanish from everyday life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/13.mp3"},{"answer":"For although humans have sewn and knitted their own clothing for a very long time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/14.mp3"},{"answer":"many of these craft-based skills went into decline","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/15.mp3"},{"answer":"when industrial machines took over -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/16.mp3"},{"answer":"mainly because they were no longer passed down from one generation to another.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/17.mp3"},{"answer":"However, that's all changing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and interest in knitting classes in many countries is actually rising,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/19.mp3"},{"answer":"as more and more people are seeking formal instruction in the skill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/20.mp3"},{"answer":"With that trend, we're also seeing an increase in the sales figures for knitting equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So why do people want to be taught to knit","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/22.mp3"},{"answer":"at a time when a machine can readily do the job for them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The answer is that knitting, as a handicraft,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/24.mp3"},{"answer":"has numerous benefits for those doing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's consider what some of these might be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/26.mp3"},{"answer":"While many people knitted garments in the past","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/27.mp3"},{"answer":"because they couldn't afford to buy clothes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/28.mp3"},{"answer":"it's still true today that knitting can be helpful","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/29.mp3"},{"answer":"if you're experiencing economic hardship.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/30.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have several children who all need warm winter clothes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/31.mp3"},{"answer":"knitting may save you a lot of money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/32.mp3"},{"answer":"And the results of knitting your own clothes can be very rewarding,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/33.mp3"},{"answer":"even though the skills you need to get going are really quite basic","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and the financial outlay is minimal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But the more significant benefits in today's world are to do with well-being.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/36.mp3"},{"answer":"In a world where it's estimated that we spend up to nine hours a day online,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/37.mp3"},{"answer":"doing something with our hands that is craft-based makes us feel good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It releases us from the stress of a technological, fast-paced life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, let's look back a bit to early knitting activities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/40.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, no one really knows when knitting first began,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but archaeological remains have disclosed plenty of information for us to think about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/42.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the interesting things about knitting","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/43.mp3"},{"answer":"is that the earliest pieces of clothing that have been found","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/44.mp3"},{"answer":"suggest that most of the items produced were round rather than flat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Discoveries from the 3rd and 4th centuries in Egypt","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/46.mp3"},{"answer":"show that things like socks and gloves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/47.mp3"},{"answer":"that were needed to keep hands and feet warm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/48.mp3"},{"answer":"were knitted in one piece using four or five needles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/49.mp3"},{"answer":"That's very different from most knitting patterns today,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/50.mp3"},{"answer":"which only require two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/51.mp3"},{"answer":"What's more, the very first needles people used were hand carved out of wood","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and other natural materials, like bone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/53.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas today's needles are largely made of steel or plastic","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and make that characteristic clicking sound when someone's using them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Ancient people knitted using yarns made from linen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/56.mp3"},{"answer":"hemp, cotton and wool,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and these were often very rough on the skin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/58.mp3"},{"answer":"The spinning wheel, which allowed people to make finer yarns","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and produce much greater quantities of them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/60.mp3"},{"answer":"led to the dominance of wool in the knitting industry -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/61.mp3"},{"answer":"often favoured for its warmth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Another interesting fact about knitting","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/63.mp3"},{"answer":"is that because it was practised in so many parts of the world","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/64.mp3"},{"answer":"for so many purposes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/65.mp3"},{"answer":"regional differences in style developed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/66.mp3"},{"answer":"This visual identity has allowed researchers to match bits of knitted clothing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/67.mp3"},{"answer":"that have been unearthed over time to the region from which the wearer came","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/68.mp3"},{"answer":"or the job that he or she did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/69.mp3"},{"answer":"As I've mentioned,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/70.mp3"},{"answer":"knitting offered people from poor communities a way of making extra money","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/71.mp3"},{"answer":"while doing other tasks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/72.mp3"},{"answer":"For many centuries, it seems,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/73.mp3"},{"answer":"men, women and children took every opportunity to knit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/74.mp3"},{"answer":"for example, while watching over sheep,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/75.mp3"},{"answer":"walking to market or riding in boats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/76.mp3"},{"answer":"So, let's move on...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-4-2023-01-04-23-21-37/77.mp3"}]
